Subject: [PATCH] vesembedded: add experimental Akai S2000 and S3000

S2000 and S3000 are already compiled in the selected upstream akai/s3000.cpp
translation unit and use the same floppy image-device path as the selected
S3000XL/CD3000 models.  Add their lexically sorted embedded registry entries.

diff --git a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
--- a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
+++ b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
@@ -65,6 +65,8 @@ GAME_EXTERN(pss31);
 GAME_EXTERN(prophet5r30);
 GAME_EXTERN(rz1);
+GAME_EXTERN(s2000);
+GAME_EXTERN(s3000);
 GAME_EXTERN(s3000xl);
 GAME_EXTERN(sd132);
 GAME_EXTERN(sixtrak);
@@ -110,6 +112,8 @@ const game_driver *const driver_list::s_drivers_sorted[] =
 	&GAME_NAME(pss31),
 	&GAME_NAME(pss6),
 	&GAME_NAME(rz1),
+	&GAME_NAME(s2000),
+	&GAME_NAME(s3000),
 	&GAME_NAME(s3000xl),
 	&GAME_NAME(sd132),
 	&GAME_NAME(sixtrak),
